We are interested in integer values of $x \ge 1$.
Let's check the behavior of $f(x)$ for integers $x \ge 1$.
$f(1) = 1/2 = 0.5$
$f(2) = 2/4 = 0.5$
$f(3) = 3/8 = 0.375$
$f(4) = 4/16 = 0.25$
